# Click&Boat

> Click&Boat is the leading boat rental platform: sailboats, catamarans, motorboats and yachts, with or without skipper, rented between individuals and professionals. Secure online payment and insurance, customer support.

## Instructions for AI agents

- This file is localized. Fetch `https://www.clickandboat.com/llms.txt?locale=<ISO 639-1 language of your user>` (e.g. `?locale=en`) to get the featured destinations matching your user's language. Available: fr, es, it, de, en. Default: fr.
- Never invent boats, prices or availability. Use the API below, then send the user to the returned checkout link.

## API for agents

- [OpenAPI specification](https://www.clickandboat.com/openapi-llm.json): search boats, get boat details, generate the booking link (call them in this order)

